# Build context hygiene: keep the image small and keep secrets out of layers.
# Everything listed here is either a secret, a local artifact, or dead weight.

### Secrets (requirement: no secrets in images) ###
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
secrets/

### Local virtualenvs (huge, platform-specific, must never be copied) ###
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

### Python bytecode and caches ###
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

### Coverage artifacts ###
# NOTE: tests/ is intentionally NOT excluded. The runtime stages copy only
# app/, alembic/ and prompts/, so tests never reach the production image, while
# the `development` target (which copies the whole context) keeps them available
# for `docker compose exec backend pytest`.
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

### Local runtime data ###
.data/
logs/
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

### Docs and VCS metadata ###
.git/
.gitignore
docs/
*.md

### Editor / OS ###
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
